; The local lens substrate: a path-addressed filesystem tree of node
; envelope JSON files. Pure (filesystem + JSON + base64) so every host
; that reads or writes a lens shares ONE format — pp-remote's sync/eval
; client and the standalone nopales script host.
(library
 (name pricklypear_lens)
 (public_name pricklypear-lens)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules lens_store)
 (libraries yojson base64 unix))
